// GPU class: low
//
// States a texture edge of 256 voxels and 2 GB of texture memory, for a weak
// integrated GPU. Such a device can lose its WebGL context on a large texture
// before it reaches the edge that it reports, so the profile reduces early.
//
// Use this profile for a weak device. It holds more memory than
// `gpu/low-tablet`, and it shares the same edge.
//
// The profile is a stated value and not a measurement. Nothing probes the
// device, so a real device may hold more or less than this profile states.
//
// Load it with `?customization=gpu/low`.
{
  "bootstrap": {
    "cornerstone.gpuCapabilityProfile": "low"
  }
}
